  "issue": 407,
  "request": "Goal: Make flow resume recovery-only for issue #407. Implement only the resume recovery contract. Scope: update src/flow/lib/run-resume.js, the active-flow/resume selection helpers in src/lib/flow-manager.js as needed, target-aware status/resolve-context handoff needed by resume, and src/skills/senti.flow-resume/SKILL.md. Behavior to specify and test: resume discovery lists recovery candidates separately from normal active flows; resume --spec or a replacement explicit selection command can select a candidate that discovery showed even when .senti/.active-flow is absent; selected target identity is carried by runId/spec/worktreePath and checked by subsequent status/next-action/run target guards; stale/finalized/orphan-worktree/branch-only candidates are labeled. Out of scope: npm publish, release work, unrelated normal new-flow ACTIVE_FLOW_MISMATCH changes.",
